          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahabu umwami w’Abisirayeli na Yehoshafati umwami w’i Buyuda, bari bambaye amakanzu yabo y’inyambarabami, bicara ku ntebe z’ubwami ku mbuga yo gusekurirako ingano iri kw’irembo ry’i Samariya, abavugishwa bavugishirizwa imbere yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Zedekiya mwene Kenayana yari yarakoze amahembe y’icuma, aca avuga ati: “Uku ni ko ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " avuze: ‘Aya ni yo uzokwicisha Abasiriya gushika ubaranduye.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
